LinkingTo:
    Rcpp
SystemRequirements: C++17, Fortran; optional Apple Metal framework on
    macOS for native Metal embedding backends; optional CUDA Toolkit with
    cuFFT, cuBLAS, cuSOLVER, and RAPIDS RAFT/cuML headers/libraries for native
    CUDA embedding backends; optional FAISS/cuVS nearest-neighbor support is
    provided by the companion faissR package and is not vendored in fastEmbedR
